WEBVTT

00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:39.333
Hurry.

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:45.125
Get inside.

00:01:06.292 --> 00:01:07.458
Wow, Chander!

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:09.583
I was expecting something else.

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:11.125
That's the problem.

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.667
What were you expecting, anyway?

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.083
Something boring.

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:19.792
A house with zero personality.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:20.875
Excuse me?

00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:24.708
I'm not boring at all, as you can see.

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:27.542
I'm a bit less colorful than you, but…

00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:29.292
that's about it.

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:34.083
Anyway, I was thinking…

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.167
If I don't find another PG,

00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:39.417
should I just move in here?

00:01:42.292 --> 00:01:43.333
What's wrong?

00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.833
- Seriously?
- Yeah, is there a problem?

00:01:46.917 --> 00:01:48.167
No, there's…

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:51.292
There's no problem,
but I was just thinking that

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:54.667
we just met a few days ago.

00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:58.917
Relax. I was just kidding.

00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:01.042
Kidding?

00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:08.250
You know, your face has

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:10.958
that kind of energy.

00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:12.500
What kind of energy?

00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:14.542
Like you're…

00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:17.208
a virgin guy,

00:02:18.458 --> 00:02:20.458
bringing a girl home for the first time.

00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:26.167
Another assumption.

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:31.042
You know, I've always wanted

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:34.542
someone to come over to my place
at 2:00 a.m.

00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:38.375
But it ended up being you.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.208
{\an8}Dried apricot, dried kiwi…

00:03:34.417 --> 00:03:36.083
{\an8}What about dried raisins?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.333
{\an8}- Hey!
- Hey!

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:47.833
I'm just checking whether
my Preet's blog has gone viral yet.

00:03:47.917 --> 00:03:49.250
Not every blog goes viral.

00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:51.583
Well, yours should.
You're such a good writer.

00:03:55.042 --> 00:03:57.917
Have you heard of the travel vlogger
Sagarika Chhetri?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.708
She wants to come and interview us.

00:03:59.792 --> 00:04:01.625
She also wants to showcase our cafe.

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:04.583
- Should I say yes to her?
- What's all this, man?

00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:09.000
I know, I know, but it could
really benefit the cafe.

00:04:09.583 --> 00:04:10.708
So, please.

00:04:13.292 --> 00:04:16.208
Well, this cafe is yours,
and so is Chander Sharma.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.042
Your wish is my command.

00:04:19.917 --> 00:04:20.833
Cute.

00:04:27.417 --> 00:04:28.458
Preet.

00:04:31.708 --> 00:04:32.792
Thank you.

00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:38.333
I know I don't say it very often, but…

00:04:40.583 --> 00:04:45.042
C, if you're going to say nice things
about me, do it with some style.

00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:48.333
Alright then!

00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:57.375
No, but I mean it.

00:04:58.292 --> 00:05:00.333
You are my reason for being, Preeti.

00:05:02.417 --> 00:05:03.792
Musafir Cafe,

00:05:05.208 --> 00:05:07.125
this little life we've built…

00:05:08.476 --> 00:05:09.625
Everything.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.125
None of this
would've been possible without you.

00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:25.750
So…

00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:31.000
So, I'll…

00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:32.750
close up the kitchen.

00:05:34.417 --> 00:05:35.292
And then?

00:05:39.417 --> 00:05:41.958
And then we'll head home
and finish our dance.

00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:45.583
- Dance?
- Yup.

00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:50.000
Okay.

00:06:44.083 --> 00:06:45.083
You know,

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:49.208
the things you couldn't express
are written all over your book choices.

00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:51.833
What did you gather, Madam Lawyer?

00:06:51.917 --> 00:06:55.042
Why you ran away from
software engineering.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.625
Turns out you're a dreamer.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.708
Something's stirring inside you, right?

00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:06.292
As if you're in search of something.

00:07:07.042 --> 00:07:08.958
- Right?
- Spread the sheets.

00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:15.125
You can take the bed.

00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:18.167
I'll set up mine outside.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.792
Will you be able to sleep there?

00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:23.208
If I sleep here,
I don't think I'll be able to.

00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:28.125
A swing!

00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:43.167
Do you drink?

00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:57.042
Once a month or so,

00:07:57.792 --> 00:08:01.417
a small drink makes me feel so good.

00:08:01.917 --> 00:08:03.208
Same. Same.

00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:09.667
This bottle belongs to my friend.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.458
I don't drink much.

00:08:11.542 --> 00:08:12.625
So why today?

00:08:13.917 --> 00:08:15.333
To impress me?

00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:18.542
You're already impressed,
or else you wouldn't be here.

00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:23.833
At this hour of the night, at the house
of a rejected marriage proposal.

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:26.542
That's the problem with life.

00:08:28.292 --> 00:08:30.375
People like you show up a little late.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.583
And people like you don't stay long.

00:08:35.542 --> 00:08:36.458
Right?

00:08:50.417 --> 00:08:51.542
Chander?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.917
Just checking you didn't
get scared and run away.

00:08:58.417 --> 00:09:01.167
I'm terrified, but where would I go?

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.583
This is my house.

00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:28.042
If you fell, a fracture was guaranteed.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.750
How could I have fallen?
You were there.

00:09:30.833 --> 00:09:34.417
If I hadn't shown up, what would
have happened to your travelers?

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:37.708
How would everyone get
Queen Preeti Kaushik's expert guidance?

00:09:37.792 --> 00:09:39.333
What did I train you for?

00:09:40.417 --> 00:09:41.542
Let it go.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.583
Okay then.

00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:57.167
- See you in the evening. Bye. Take care.
- Your group is ready.

00:09:58.458 --> 00:09:59.375
I know.

00:10:00.208 --> 00:10:01.167
Bye.

00:10:01.917 --> 00:10:02.917
C, wait.

00:10:07.667 --> 00:10:08.625
I'll see you.

00:10:32.417 --> 00:10:33.333
Ishan.

00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:36.458
Thank you.

00:10:38.417 --> 00:10:39.917
- Hello.
- Hi.

00:10:46.292 --> 00:10:47.875
Don't fangirls bother you?

00:10:47.958 --> 00:10:49.000
Not at all.

00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:52.042
In today's social media age,

00:10:52.125 --> 00:10:54.208
if someone reads an entire book with love,

00:10:54.292 --> 00:10:57.958
I don't see it as a bother
but as motivation.

00:10:59.417 --> 00:11:00.667
Anyway, today's question.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:02.708
- Ready?
- Always.

00:11:03.333 --> 00:11:07.000
The most memorable moment
from your favorite solo adventure.

00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:10.292
Something that left
a deep impression on you.

00:11:17.042 --> 00:11:18.167
Turtuk.

00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:21.667
India's last village. In Ladakh.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.333
- Have you been there?
- Take me with you next time.

00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:27.417
- Why not?
- No, I…

00:11:27.917 --> 00:11:29.167
I meant it.

00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:34.125
You know, I've known you for three months,

00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:36.875
but there's one thing I don't get.

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:37.833
What now?

00:11:37.917 --> 00:11:41.667
I don't know, but whenever we meet
and talk, I keep wondering

00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:46.000
what this girl has been doing
in the same place for three years!

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.083
There's something
you don't want to let go of.

00:11:52.485 --> 00:11:54.000
I've also found something.

00:11:56.375 --> 00:11:57.917
Rahil, you don't need

00:11:58.917 --> 00:12:01.833
grand plans in life, only simple ones.

00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:05.833
If plans become too grand,
there's no space left for life.

00:12:07.333 --> 00:12:09.625
So, I truly live in the moment.

00:12:12.958 --> 00:12:14.250
I spoke to my publisher.

00:12:15.125 --> 00:12:16.125
What?!

00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:20.292
Man, I shouldn't have told you!

00:12:20.375 --> 00:12:24.583
Listen, writing my blog
is only my hobby.

00:12:24.667 --> 00:12:26.625
I'm not a serious writer like you.

00:12:28.417 --> 00:12:30.167
I'm officially trapped now.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.784
You've been trapped for
the last three months, Preeti.

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:36.042
You just don't want to admit it.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.375
Do people in your age group
really flirt this way?

00:12:42.458 --> 00:12:45.042
Age group? Wait…

00:12:46.458 --> 00:12:49.708
Only the flirting style changes with age.

00:12:49.792 --> 00:12:51.417
The intent remains the same.

00:12:55.458 --> 00:12:57.000
But you only read a few pages.

00:12:57.083 --> 00:12:58.542
That was more than enough.

00:12:59.292 --> 00:13:01.833
Your travelogues will be
very unique, Preeti.

00:13:02.542 --> 00:13:05.542
I wonder how many girls
want to travel alone,

00:13:05.625 --> 00:13:07.375
and all they need

00:13:07.458 --> 00:13:10.333
is a little bit of Preeti Kaushik
in their lives to inspire them.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:16.167
You know, travelers don't just…

00:13:17.958 --> 00:13:19.500
change their location.

00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.958
They also travel within themselves.

00:13:23.833 --> 00:13:26.042
You're only paused, not tied down.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.250
Write.

00:13:33.042 --> 00:13:34.083
For yourself.

00:13:36.042 --> 00:13:38.625
Thanks for the tea. Bye.

00:13:47.708 --> 00:13:50.333
<i>Walking down new paths</i>
<i>is always a little scary.</i>

00:13:51.542 --> 00:13:55.667
<i>But perhaps that's exactly what tells you</i>
<i>a new chapter is beginning.</i>

00:14:23.167 --> 00:14:24.500
You tried to make coffee?

00:14:24.583 --> 00:14:25.833
Correction, my lord.

00:14:25.917 --> 00:14:28.968
Your kitchen feels less like a kitchen
and more like a chemistry lab.

00:14:29.043 --> 00:14:30.375
You should have asked for permission.

00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:34.875
My coffee machines have
a very weak emotional system.

00:14:36.333 --> 00:14:38.167
Your machines' or yours?

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.667
- Chai.
- Change.

00:15:27.458 --> 00:15:28.667
Your chai.

00:15:30.125 --> 00:15:31.167
Thank you.

00:15:40.458 --> 00:15:43.250
This tea is ridiculously good!

00:15:44.667 --> 00:15:45.542
Thank you.

00:15:45.625 --> 00:15:46.958
I'd say I'm pretty lucky.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.542
A place to live,
and quite a grand one too.

00:15:50.625 --> 00:15:52.792
And now this heavenly tea.

00:15:52.875 --> 00:15:54.875
Wow! Chander!

00:15:59.333 --> 00:16:02.083
If your next flat doesn't have a lift,
I'm not coming, <i>bhaiya.</i>

00:16:04.292 --> 00:16:05.167
Good morning.

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:09.375
She's a friend.

00:16:09.458 --> 00:16:11.875
No, not a friend.
She's a friend's sister.

00:16:12.667 --> 00:16:15.458
Remember Sonu, who came over last week?
She's his sister.

00:16:15.542 --> 00:16:18.500
So, she'll stay with us for a few days.

00:16:20.875 --> 00:16:21.833
She's a guest.

00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:25.333
No.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.667
This is Sudha.

00:16:30.417 --> 00:16:32.333
- Did he make tea?
- Yes.

00:16:32.833 --> 00:16:34.250
He really makes great tea, doesn't he?

00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:36.542
Yes, I was just praising it.

00:16:36.625 --> 00:16:38.000
I'm glad you came.

00:16:38.083 --> 00:16:41.000
Sometimes, I feel like
even these walls must be bored.

00:16:41.083 --> 00:16:43.417
Of him and all his books!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:44.708
<i>Didi?</i>

00:16:45.875 --> 00:16:47.333
What did I say?

00:16:47.875 --> 00:16:49.583
I'm saying you enjoyed the tea, right?

00:16:49.667 --> 00:16:51.667
You should stay a few more days then.

00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:54.458
<i>Bhaiya,</i> I brought the groceries.

00:16:54.542 --> 00:16:56.000
It's worth 300 rupees.

00:16:56.083 --> 00:16:57.708
- Wait, I'll pay.
- I got it.

00:16:58.208 --> 00:16:59.250
We'll settle it later.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.667
Alright, I'll come later.

00:17:04.458 --> 00:17:06.542
Aren't you going to Indore today, <i>bhaiya?</i>

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:07.500
Yes.

00:17:08.542 --> 00:17:09.917
I'll see you again, right?

00:17:12.958 --> 00:17:14.333
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:17:17.125 --> 00:17:18.000
<i>Didi!</i>

00:17:20.042 --> 00:17:21.333
Don't worry, <i>bhaiya.</i>

00:17:21.417 --> 00:17:24.042
I didn't see anything,
and I didn't hear anything.

00:17:24.125 --> 00:17:26.458
- Aunty Tyagi won't find out either.
- Thank you.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.625
<i>Bhaiya…</i>

00:17:44.333 --> 00:17:46.042
Your <i>didi </i>is amazing!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.083
You're pretty amazing too.

00:17:55.917 --> 00:17:58.708
Yes, sir. Yes, I'm fully prepared
for the closing.

00:17:59.333 --> 00:18:01.458
Yes, sir.
I'll see you in court in an hour.

00:18:14.542 --> 00:18:16.417
Should I drop you off at court?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.542
No, it's okay.

00:18:18.083 --> 00:18:20.000
I have a hearing at 11 o'clock, so…

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.833
I'll leave in half an hour
after my final prep.

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:24.083
Okay.

00:18:24.167 --> 00:18:25.583
Hey, listen.

00:18:26.917 --> 00:18:29.833
Is it okay if I stay another night?

00:18:29.917 --> 00:18:31.958
Just until I decide what my next move is.

00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:35.917
Gargi's already called six times anyway,
so I'll figure something out.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:36.958
Take your time.

00:18:38.125 --> 00:18:40.458
It'll take me two days to get back. So…

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:42.833
feel at home.

00:18:45.042 --> 00:18:46.167
Okay, bye.

00:18:49.458 --> 00:18:50.542
Listen.

00:18:54.583 --> 00:18:55.708
Thank you.

00:18:57.792 --> 00:19:01.500
I didn't say that out of formality.

00:19:03.125 --> 00:19:04.417
I meant it from the heart.

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:08.875
If I don't leave now…

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.542
it'll be too late.

00:19:21.208 --> 00:19:22.208
- Bye.
- Bye.

00:19:56.167 --> 00:19:58.875
Perhaps my learned friend didn't consider

00:19:58.958 --> 00:20:01.333
that if my client only wanted money,

00:20:01.417 --> 00:20:03.708
why would she stay with a man

00:20:03.792 --> 00:20:08.333
who subjected her to daily physical
and mental torture for seven years?

00:20:08.417 --> 00:20:10.458
Section 13, sub-section one,

00:20:10.542 --> 00:20:12.917
sub-clause IA of the Hindu Marriage Act

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:16.500
clearly defines physical
and mental cruelty as grounds for divorce.

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:19.542
Your Honor, my client
doesn't just want money.

00:20:19.625 --> 00:20:22.125
She demands the right
to live as a human being.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.333
That's all, Your Honor.

00:20:28.042 --> 00:20:29.833
Thank you so much, Sudha<i> ji.</i>

00:20:29.917 --> 00:20:31.792
No, ma'am, it's my job.

00:20:32.667 --> 00:20:33.792
- Bye.
- Bye.

00:20:35.792 --> 00:20:37.167
Well done, Sudha.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.000
- Thank you, sir.
- Congratulations.

00:20:39.083 --> 00:20:39.958
Thank you.

00:20:40.042 --> 00:20:42.250
There's a very big firm in Mumbai,

00:20:42.333 --> 00:20:44.833
and they need a lawyer like you.

00:20:44.917 --> 00:20:47.000
So, I recommended your name.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:50.417
Think about it.
I'll share the details with you.

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:52.917
But I think you're ready for it.

00:20:53.583 --> 00:20:54.667
Thank you, sir.

00:21:03.792 --> 00:21:06.625
Yes, Mom, it might be a good proposal,
but not right now.

00:21:09.708 --> 00:21:12.333
Mom, "not right now" doesn't mean never.

00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:15.167
I just need a little more time
right now, that's it.

00:21:16.417 --> 00:21:18.125
I will, I definitely will.

00:21:19.667 --> 00:21:21.083
Yes, okay. Take care of yourself.

00:21:21.167 --> 00:21:22.458
I'm hanging up. Bye.

00:21:29.167 --> 00:21:31.792
- What's her name, Chander?
- Whose, sir?

00:21:32.542 --> 00:21:36.458
The one whose messages
make you smile every ten minutes.

00:21:38.917 --> 00:21:40.833
No, sir, it's nothing like that.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:12.042
THE MUMBAI OFFER IS CONFIRMED.
JUST NEED TO DECIDE ON THE CALL TOMORROW

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:21.125
GIVE ME YOUR TEA RECIPE
FOR TOMORROW MORNING. YOU'RE SPOILING ME.

00:23:33.625 --> 00:23:35.583
<i>When you get bored with logistics,</i>

00:23:36.208 --> 00:23:38.083
<i>you should set up your own cafe.</i>

00:24:29.292 --> 00:24:30.333
Sorry.

00:24:31.333 --> 00:24:32.792
I'm pretty late today.

00:24:36.875 --> 00:24:37.958
What are you reading?

00:24:38.500 --> 00:24:39.542
Rafael Thakur.

00:24:40.083 --> 00:24:42.042
Yuck! What a terrible author.

00:24:42.125 --> 00:24:44.292
Speaking of terrible authors…

00:24:45.333 --> 00:24:47.083
Rahil seems interesting.

00:24:49.125 --> 00:24:52.542
Firstly, he's not terrible at all.

00:24:53.250 --> 00:24:55.000
Secondly, he's just a friend.

00:24:55.083 --> 00:24:57.625
Yeah, when did I say he was anything else?

00:25:00.458 --> 00:25:01.833
One second.

00:25:01.917 --> 00:25:04.625
I've never seen you
notice all this before.

00:25:04.708 --> 00:25:06.750
I notice everything, madam.

00:25:07.250 --> 00:25:08.667
I just never have to act on it.

00:25:09.333 --> 00:25:12.083
Because people come to Musafir Cafe,

00:25:12.708 --> 00:25:15.292
but before they leave,
they end up becoming

00:25:15.375 --> 00:25:17.667
permanent members
of Preeti Kaushik's fan club.

00:25:18.917 --> 00:25:20.000
And you?

00:25:21.250 --> 00:25:22.875
What's your role in this fan club?

00:25:22.958 --> 00:25:24.083
Me?

00:25:25.458 --> 00:25:27.958
I'm the founder. Resident Fan.

00:25:29.625 --> 00:25:32.417
So, Mr. Resident Fan,
I have a small request.

00:25:32.500 --> 00:25:33.875
Tell me.

00:25:34.417 --> 00:25:36.333
Next time you feel even a little jealous,

00:25:36.417 --> 00:25:38.875
please just tell me!

00:25:38.958 --> 00:25:41.250
You have no idea what your jealousy
does to my heart.

00:25:41.333 --> 00:25:42.458
What? Jealous?

00:25:42.542 --> 00:25:44.667
Look, I don't need to be jealous.

00:25:44.750 --> 00:25:47.625
- Oh, please!
- I have no reason to be jealous.

00:25:48.125 --> 00:25:49.583
Because what we have

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:52.542
is my reality.

00:25:53.750 --> 00:25:56.875
For people like your Rahil,

00:25:57.417 --> 00:25:59.125
it's just a distant dream.

00:26:00.208 --> 00:26:02.083
I want to show you something.

00:26:02.792 --> 00:26:03.792
Now?

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:08.208
- You have such a bad sense of timing!
- Okay!

00:26:08.833 --> 00:26:12.458
So, a reading room, a performance room,

00:26:12.542 --> 00:26:13.958
a meditation room,

00:26:14.042 --> 00:26:16.417
and four studio apartments
on the first floor.

00:26:17.292 --> 00:26:18.292
That's it.

00:26:23.458 --> 00:26:26.125
This is beautiful, but you know I…

00:26:28.375 --> 00:26:30.542
Isn't this extension plan a bit much?

00:26:31.792 --> 00:26:34.333
The cafe and guesthouse
were your dream, C.

00:26:35.167 --> 00:26:36.958
And the artist residency is mine.

00:26:38.208 --> 00:26:40.417
Yeah, of course, I know that. But…

00:26:42.042 --> 00:26:45.750
I was just thinking,
isn't this a huge commitment?

00:26:45.833 --> 00:26:48.750
Think it through.
I just want you to be sure.

00:26:48.833 --> 00:26:50.792
What makes you think I'm not?

00:26:51.708 --> 00:26:53.333
Of course, I am.

00:26:57.417 --> 00:26:59.500
Yeah. Fine.

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:16.750
<i>Who hides whiskey?</i>

00:27:17.417 --> 00:27:19.708
<i>Is your mom coming</i>
<i>for a surprise inspection?</i>

00:27:19.792 --> 00:27:22.875
Well, when there's
a senior criminal lawyer at home,

00:27:22.958 --> 00:27:24.292
you have to hide it.

00:27:24.375 --> 00:27:26.708
<i>Turning a divorce lawyer</i>
<i>into a criminal lawyer</i>

00:27:26.792 --> 00:27:28.750
<i>is convenient for this conversation.</i>

00:27:30.833 --> 00:27:31.917
Did you eat?

00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:35.083
<i>Yeah. </i>Didi <i>made kebabs and roti.</i>

00:27:35.167 --> 00:27:36.208
<i>With a lot of love.</i>

00:27:36.708 --> 00:27:38.708
<i>You know, she even bought me flowers.</i>

00:27:38.792 --> 00:27:39.708
Nice.

00:27:39.792 --> 00:27:40.750
<i>By the way,</i>

00:27:41.792 --> 00:27:44.458
<i>without you, the house is so quiet.</i>

00:27:45.875 --> 00:27:49.000
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:27:49.542 --> 00:27:52.750
<i>Why does this intoxication keep growing?</i>

00:27:53.375 --> 00:27:56.458
<i>Why does my heart long to soar?</i>

00:27:56.542 --> 00:27:59.167
<i>You are the reason why</i>

00:28:01.000 --> 00:28:03.708
<i>Once again</i>

00:28:04.625 --> 00:28:07.833
<i>My feet have begun to dance</i>

00:28:08.583 --> 00:28:12.167
<i>And if the ground slips away beneath us</i>

00:28:12.250 --> 00:28:14.417
<i>Let's spread our wings and fly</i>

00:28:20.333 --> 00:28:22.917
<i>Oh, every day</i>

00:28:23.458 --> 00:28:26.500
<i>Find your way into my arms</i>

00:28:27.500 --> 00:28:29.292
<i>Whatever the world may say</i>

00:28:29.375 --> 00:28:33.250
<i>Let's keep moving as one, every day</i>

00:28:35.708 --> 00:28:37.708
<i>Somehow, with you, my love</i>

00:28:39.500 --> 00:28:41.708
<i>I've become a wanderer</i>

00:28:43.333 --> 00:28:45.292
<i>Come, let's take flight once again</i>

00:28:48.583 --> 00:28:50.500
<i>Come on</i>

00:28:50.583 --> 00:28:53.250
<i>Oh, every day</i>

00:28:53.750 --> 00:28:56.708
<i>Find your way into my arms</i>

00:28:57.542 --> 00:28:59.542
<i>Whatever the world may say</i>

00:28:59.625 --> 00:29:03.583
<i>Let's keep moving as one, every day</i>

00:29:05.667 --> 00:29:08.167
<i>Let's soar once more</i>

00:29:08.875 --> 00:29:12.167
<i>Find your way into my arms</i>

00:29:12.875 --> 00:29:14.625
<i>Whatever the world may say</i>

00:29:14.708 --> 00:29:18.875
<i>Let's keep moving as one, every day</i>

00:29:23.750 --> 00:29:26.208
<i>Every day</i>

00:30:02.000 --> 00:30:03.583
Weren't you supposed to return
the day after tomorrow?

00:30:03.667 --> 00:30:05.458
I had to check something important.

00:30:06.018 --> 00:30:06.875
What?

00:30:06.958 --> 00:30:09.000
<i>Without you, my love…</i>

00:30:12.875 --> 00:30:14.667
That you didn't run away.

00:30:14.750 --> 00:30:16.792
<i>My heart refused to be still</i>

00:30:29.167 --> 00:30:30.833
<i>Whatever the world may say</i>

00:30:30.917 --> 00:30:35.000
<i>Let's keep moving as one, every day</i>

00:30:37.083 --> 00:30:39.667
<i>Oh, every day</i>

00:30:40.250 --> 00:30:43.625
<i>Let the morning find me with you</i>

00:30:44.167 --> 00:30:49.875
<i>You take one step</i>
<i>And I'll take one beside you, every day</i>

00:33:15.932 --> 00:33:17.932
Subtitle translation by Neha Nair


